diff --git a/.multica/skills/pocket-checks/SKILL.md b/.multica/skills/pocket-checks/SKILL.md
new file mode 100644
index 00000000..b3d8cd0a
--- /dev/null
+++ b/.multica/skills/pocket-checks/SKILL.md
@@ -0,0 +1,23 @@
+---
+name: pocket-checks
+description: Pick and run the checks that cover a holt change by area, the same way for the owner and the independent reviewer. Use in orchestrated Pocket and Studio runs.
+---
+
+# Pocket checks
+
+1. Area from the issue label (`area:*`) and the changed paths (`git diff --name-only origin/main...HEAD`).
+2. Run the checks for every touched area. Never assemble cargo or tsc by hand.
+
+| Paths | Check |
+|---|---|
+| crates/, host code | `pocket dev <app> --target macos-app` smoke, `bun run test --project host` |
+| compiler/ | `bun run test --project compiler` |
+| framework/ | `bun run test --project framework` |
+| cli/ | `bun run test --project cli` |
+| apps/<app>/ | `pocket check apps/<app>` |
+| studio/app/ | `pocket dev studio`, check the named screen, screenshot into `studio/app/.build/validation/<KEY>/` |
+| studio/control-plane/ | that package's tests |
+| any TS source | `bun check` |
+
+3. Put each command and the tail of its output in the result comment. A check you could not run is reported as not verified, with the reason.
+4. Screenshots and logs stay in ignored `.build/validation/`; never commit them.
